  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="72c59bca-ef20-5ade-a6dd-504eb9f2eb4e" activityNameId="7c6e9dde-a755-56ec-bcb8-d91785848cae" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cable, data cable in infrastructure, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cable, data cable in infrastructure, at plant
The data represent a mixture (50:50) of metallic and metal-free glasfibre cable for the transfer of data. Material data are taken from datasheet of a producer of such cables. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions. The dataset is an average of cables with a meter-weight of 0.03 resp. 0.079 kg/m. In 2023 updates, material and energy input are now represented by global inventory flows; Geography: Data from one Swiss producer, used as representative for the global situation.; UUID: 65aec195-832d-3b1b-8d8d-0bcac2160392
This module includes material, an estimation of the production efforts (transportation, energy, process chemicals, …) and of the infrastructure for the production of a three-conductor cable used in the construction of new buildings. No information about emissions (air, water) and waste are included.
Location: Data from one Swiss producer, used as representative for the global situation.
Technology: Mix of two types of cable. Data from one producer of such cables.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_65aec195-832d-3b1b-8d8d-0bcac2160392.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
